<Base title="Privacy Policy" noindex>
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy Policy" />
  <div class="wrap"><LegalDraftNotice /></div>
  <section class="wrap legal-body"><aside><a class="back-link" href="/legal/">← Legal</a></aside><div class="prose"><h2>What we collect</h2><p>This website does not offer accounts, run analytics, or set its own tracking cookies. If you contact us by email once contact information is published, the information you choose to send will be used to respond to you and manage that correspondence.</p><h2>Technical requests</h2><p>Like other websites, the hosting provider may process basic technical information, such as your IP address and request details, to deliver the site and maintain security. This site also loads its typefaces from Google Fonts, so your browser may contact Google to retrieve them.</p><h2>External links and files</h2><p>Links to other websites have their own privacy practices. Downloading a magazine PDF or playing an audio file may create normal web request records with the hosting provider.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Our contact details will be listed on the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> when available. This policy will be updated if the site’s data practices change.</p></div></section>
</Base>
